# BPO Ops Superflow — Scaffold Implementation Plan

Scaffold a monorepo multi-agent AI system for call center BPO optimization using CrewAI, FastAPI, FastMCP, and React. The existing repo is a challenge starter template with [example_flow.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/example_flow.py), `mock_data/`, and `docs/`. We will add three service directories alongside the existing files, plus Docker orchestration.

## Proposed Changes

### Documentation

#### [NEW] [project_specs.md](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/docs/project_specs.md)
Core specification document covering:
- System overview & objectives (EU AI Act HITL compliance)
- Agent responsibilities (InputGatekeeper, TranscriptAnalyzer, DemandForecaster, LeaveAnalyzer, PerfAwareScheduler, TrainerDesigner, ShiftSwapCoordinator, Router)
- Shared state schema (Pydantic `BPOFlowState` with ~20 typed fields)
- Flow types: `training`, `schedule`, `hybrid`, `leave_review`, `shift_swap`
- HITL checkpoint contract (pause → SSE event → manager decision → resume)

#### [NEW] [architecture.md](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/docs/architecture.md)
Architecture document with Mermaid diagrams covering:
- 4-tier system diagram (React → FastAPI → CrewAI → FastMCP)
- Data flow sequence diagram
- SSE event schema
- API endpoint contract table
- HITL state machine

