### Backend — CrewAI + FastAPI (`backend/`)

#### [NEW] [models/state.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/models/state.py)
Pydantic models:
- `BPOFlowState` — main shared state (~20 fields incl. `leave_report`, `swap_request`, `swap_result`)
- `TeamPerfMetrics`, `DemandForecast`, `ScheduleOutput`, `TrainingPlan` — core pipeline models
- `LeaveReport`, `AgentLeave`, `LeaveOverlap`, `CoverageGap` — leave analysis models
- `SwapRequest`, `ShiftSwapResult`, `ScheduleIntersection` — shift swap models
- `HITLDecision`, `AuditLogEntry` — HITL-related types
- `FlowType` — Literal enum (`"training" | "schedule" | "hybrid" | "leave_review" | "shift_swap"`)
- `APIError` — typed error model (no generic catch-all)

