#### [NEW] [agents/__init__.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/agents/__init__.py)

#### [NEW] [flow/bpo_flow.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/flow/bpo_flow.py)
CrewAI Flow class (`BPOSuperflow`) with:
- `@start()` → `input_gatekeeper` (validates and initializes state)
- `@listen(input_gatekeeper)` → `analyze_transcripts` (invokes TranscriptAnalyzer)
- `@listen(analyze_transcripts)` → `forecast_demand` (invokes DemandForecaster)
- `@listen(forecast_demand)` → `analyze_leave` (invokes LeaveAnalyzer)
- `@router(analyze_leave)` → `route_by_flow_type` (returns `"training"`, `"schedule"`, `"hybrid"`, `"leave_review"`, or `"shift_swap"`)
- `@listen("schedule")` / `@listen("hybrid")` → `generate_schedule` (invokes PerfAwareScheduler)
- `@listen("training")` / `@listen("hybrid")` → `design_training` (invokes TrainerDesigner)
- `@listen("shift_swap")` → `coordinate_swap` (invokes ShiftSwapCoordinator)
- `@listen("leave_review")` → skips to HITL with leave report only
- `@listen(generate_schedule, design_training, coordinate_swap)` → `hitl_checkpoint`
- `@listen(hitl_checkpoint)` → [finalize](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/example_flow.py#255-268) — resumes after HITL decision, writes audit log

#### [NEW] [flow/__init__.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/flow/__init__.py)

#### [NEW] [main.py](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/main.py)
FastAPI application:
- `POST /api/flow/start` — accepts `FlowStartRequest` (flow_type, queue_id, time_window, optional swap_request), spins up flow in background, returns `run_id`
- `GET /api/flow/{run_id}/stream` — SSE endpoint streaming `audit_log` and state changes
- `GET /api/flow/{run_id}/state` — returns current `BPOFlowState`
- `POST /api/flow/{run_id}/hitl` — accepts `HITLDecision` (approve/edit/reject + optional edits), resumes flow
- CORS middleware configured for frontend dev server
- Typed error responses (not generic catch-all)

#### [NEW] [requirements.txt](file:///c:/Users/hossam/Desktop/crewai-bpo-challenge/backend/requirements.txt)
- `crewai[tools]>=0.100.0`, `pydantic>=2.0`, `python-dotenv`, `litellm`, `fastapi`, `uvicorn[standard]`, `sse-starlette`

